"they are invited.  To invite someone, a channel operator needs to issue the "
"command <em>/invite nick</em> from within the channel.</qt>"
msgstr ""

#: src/channel.cpp:156
msgid ""
"<qt>These control the <em>mode</em> of the channel.  Only an operator can "
"change these."
